  SpeakImagePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  FadeUI: {fileID: 0}
  cutsceneCamera: []
  cutsceneLine: 
  endCutsceneLine: 0
  DialogueBox: {fileID: 190816187}
  textComponent: {fileID: 627566914}
  lines:
  - Long long ago, scholars of the arcane lived in harmony with the natural world.
  - A guild of these arcane scholars, known as the Elemental Wizards, had mastered
    controlling the natural world using magic.
  - They used these powers to help the people of our realm, using <b><color=#ff3300>Fire</color></b>
    to bring warmth and <b><color=#0073bf>Water</color></b> to quench thirst.
  - Everything changed when one day, the guild leader <b><color=#541834>Skar</color></b>
    decided to harness the natural elements for himself and his guild.
  - He sealed the elements in set regions under only his control, guarded by Arcane
    Golems of his creation.
  - The guild became known as the <b><color=#541834>Shadow Gang</color></b>, and
    fled to these locations never to be seen again.
  - As a reward for their loyalty, he bestowed the power of each element to three
    of the <b><color=#541834>Shadow Gang</color></b> members.
  - The fourth member, <b><color=#8134ad>Maguso</color></b>, was left with nothing.
    <b><color=#541834>Skar</color></b> denied him his promised share of power, proving
    how little his loyalty meant.
  - Cast aside and left without any power, <b><color=#8134ad>Maguso</color></b> was
    caught by bounty hunters and imprisoned by Mayor Dinkleberry.
  - This is <b><color=#8134ad>his</color></b> story of redemption...
  hasSecondaryLines: 0
  secondaryLines: []
  textSpeed: 0.05
  happyIndex: -1
  angryIndex: -1
  secondaryHappyIndex: -1
